  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YAL - Abuga - Ecobora</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Waste Management .Beneficiaries: YAL Youth 617 of which 612 are women. ..The grant will be used to create a cheap, more environmentally friendly fuel for families. They are easy to light as they are uniquely blended with eco-lighters thus save families additional recurruinf cost in paraffin. They will train more than 200 women on wood pellet production and entrepreneurship skills though which 34 will be employed as sales agents. ..The grant funds will be used to: (a) new facility to produce the pellets; (b) efficient pellet machine; and (c) raw materials for input. .</narrative>
  </description>
